===
### name: op.logic.or-short-circuits
--- source
TRUE OR (1 / 0 == 0)
--- expect
bool TRUE
===
### name: op.logic.xor
--- source
TRUE XOR TRUE
--- expect
bool FALSE
===
### name: op.logic.no-truthiness
--- source
"x" AND TRUE
--- expect
error E_NOT_BOOL at 1:1
===
### name: op.logic.not
--- source
NOT FALSE
--- expect
bool TRUE
===

